+     info
+         le bit set-user-id, `04000`

@ 0 1 0 177fa36f40891c3112c175cb7a75d135
+   entry #setGid
+     info
+         le bit set-group-id, `02000`

@ 0 1 0 06a64e8553b3bc7008f75a5b4547d50e
